      "content": "thanks. i have sumatriptan here too, i usually take 50mg but this feels way more intense than usual. do you think it's safe if i just take 200mg all at once to try and knock it out fast? also my face is starting to feel a bit tingly and numb on that same side, is that just part of the aura? i'd really rather just sleep it off than deal with a hospital visit if i can help it.",
